  "review": [
    {
      "section": "time.clock",
      "confidence": "medium",
      "note": "Rewrote to the spoken Hong Kong Cantonese 字 (5-minute unit) system: 兩點一個字 (2:05), 兩點三個字 (2:15), 兩點半, 兩點九個字 (2:45); o'clock as 點正 rather than the Mandarin-flavoured 點整. Used the full 'X個字' form everywhere rather than the shortened 點三/點九 so every slot is unambiguous. Formal 分 readings were correct, so this is a naturalness change."
